messages.text:
Got it, and written down so I keep it:

- anything involving other people or a new commitment → I ask you first;
- routine clashes with your existing blocks → I use my judgement and book around them;
- anyone asking for you directly → I tell you.

So: a staff meeting or an invitation from someone else — I check with you before committing. A lecture moving into a gap or an office-hour slot that doesn't fit — I just solve it and keep the log.
